{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-89","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-89"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815900-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-89","missionId":"event-rogue-89","mission":"돌아온 세양","scene":"돌아온 세양","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"검푸른 화염이 무명객의 열차를 집어삼킨다. 차 안에서는 익숙하고 간사한 웃음소리가 들려오고, 음산한 기운에 당신은 등골이 오싹해진다","talkId":403815900,"textHash":"17957100873980740667","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:89/talk-403815900","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8d911148a2cbb55a","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815901-line"],"bwikiPage":"归来的岁阳","bwikiRevision":58165,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12976","bwikiMission":"돌아온 세양"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815901-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-89","missionId":"event-rogue-89","mission":"돌아온 세양","scene":"돌아온 세양","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「벌레야, 오랜만이야. 생각도 못 했지? 나 탈출에 성공했어」 고개를 들어보니 부연의 커다란 눈이 당신을 노려보고 있다. 분노와 오만함, 두 가지 색으로 이뤄진 화염이 그 눈 안에서 맹렬하게 불타오른다","talkId":403815901,"textHash":"9932731331136051660","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:89/talk-403815901","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8d911148a2cbb55a","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815902-line"],"bwikiPage":"归来的岁阳","bwikiRevision":58165,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12976","bwikiMission":"돌아온 세양"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815902-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-89","missionId":"event-rogue-89","mission":"돌아온 세양","scene":"돌아온 세양","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"이 데이터를 어디서 구했는지는 모르겠지만, 당신은 시뮬레이션 버전이 원본보다도 더 짜증난다고 느낀다","talkId":403815902,"textHash":"14505333553246203067","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:89/talk-403815902","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8d911148a2cbb55a","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815903-line"],"bwikiPage":"归来的岁阳","bwikiRevision":58165,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12976","bwikiMission":"돌아온 세양"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815903-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-89","missionId":"event-rogue-89","mission":"돌아온 세양","scene":"돌아온 세양","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「내가 했던 말 기억해? 무명객과 선주에 당한 모욕을 오늘 배로 갚아주겠어!」 대세양이 건방지게 소리친다","talkId":403815903,"textHash":"11330779122893293506","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:89/talk-403815903","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8d911148a2cbb55a","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"归来的岁阳","bwikiRevision":58165,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12976","bwikiMission":"돌아온 세양"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-text-18330918909809275286-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-89","missionId":"event-rogue-89","mission":"돌아온 세양","scene":"돌아온 세양","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"지고 나서 울지 마","talkId":null,"textHash":"18330918909809275286","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:89/text-18330918909809275286","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"39df51a1d29d88e4","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"归来的岁阳","bwikiRevision":58165,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12976","bwikiMission":"돌아온 세양"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815900-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815901-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815902-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-talk-403815903-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-89-text-18330918909809275286-choice"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":5,"reviewRows":0,"segments":2,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}